This level consists of user interface and the dashboard. It directly communicates with the user and presents the outcomes of the data analysis.
•	Application Tier
This layer holds the business logic and analysis scripts. It works with data and interacts both with the presentation and data layers.
•	Data Tier
At this level is the database which contains all the data. It guarantees the efficient and secure data management.
